    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5abce26e01031a80d5a7c263",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "近年来，赛跑界与娱乐实现了融合发展。\n因此，粉丝对马娘传达喜爱的方式也变得多种多样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f766a0fa95d5cbc2c46a52bd538ef33ad2541f3a88fd3c68efe3a2bfc6e372c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1132/storytimeline_041132001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab244a9ba5f8bef2b22c752",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其中以跑者的战绩吸引目光的为传统形式。\n马娘在比赛中展示力量，而粉丝们则沉醉于其强大的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d11dcf24c861a6c0d42f73bf82336c8c7bd0fa78b6a41119a1ed82de5a8da12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1132/storytimeline_041132001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34d0621868dd0459c366c986",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一种是近年来在赛跑以外的方面也发挥魅力的形式。\n以偶像般的才能吸引众多粉丝的人也不在少数。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9962b92f3a07e17a37f396b1a44aee77bc506208048bd8a50125a7aa6258b335",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1132/storytimeline_041132001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e80c8044d61e4c4ec87d0a37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "马娘和粉丝的关系是多种多样的，\n但放在唯独爱你身上，无论哪种都与之有些许不同。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac0aa7190858480230b8d423399b9f4c8590f5ce7a9eefe0d53450bd0511441c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1132/storytimeline_041132001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e714a6a0acd9dd2977d235d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然还说不好——但我对她和粉丝所建立的关系，\n抱有一种前所未有的，像是会连接新未来一样的期待……",
      "source_fingerprint": "10d83dc65b49a27590c417bf02971f1c35e0b1abde02e8609fd3f67e79eda07e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
